Vocab/role/Group/knowledge/Hint: What you know — living, worth revisiting
Vocab/role/Group/procedure/Hint: How you go about it — living, worth revisiting
Vocab/role/Group/reuse/Hint: To copy or duplicate — living, worth revisiting
Vocab/role/Group/register/Hint: Added to, never rewritten
Vocab/role/Group/tracking/Hint: Perishable — purge once it is over

Vocab/role/concept/Hint: Idea explained for its own sake
Vocab/role/ref/Hint: Facts you come back to look up
Vocab/role/source/Hint: An outside work you consulted — book, article, video
Vocab/role/guide/Hint: How-to, step by step
Vocab/role/snippet/Hint: Fragment to copy as is
Vocab/role/template/Hint: Starting point to duplicate
Vocab/role/decision/Hint: Settled choice, and why
Vocab/role/log/Hint: What happened, dated
Vocab/role/hub/Hint: Way in to other tiddlers
Vocab/role/project/Hint: A project itself
Vocab/role/tool/Hint: A tool, or a set of tools, used in projects
Vocab/role/task/Hint: One thing to do
Vocab/role/tasklist/Hint: Tasks tracked together
Vocab/role/routine/Hint: Done again and again, on a rhythm
Vocab/maturity/stub/Hint: Too thin to be of use — needs more substance
Vocab/maturity/rough/Hint: All the substance is there, the writing still needs finishing
Vocab/maturity/stable/Hint: Reviewed, reliable, safe to build on
Vocab/lifecycle/active/Hint: In circulation
Vocab/lifecycle/obsolete/Hint: Superseded — do not rely on it
Vocab/lifecycle/archived/Hint: Kept for the record, unmaintained
Vocab/needs/verify/Hint: Its accuracy is in doubt — check it before relying on it
Vocab/needs/refactor/Hint: Overlaps other tiddlers — merge duplicates or pull out what they share
Vocab/needs/split/Hint: Too long or too mixed — break it into atomic tiddlers
Vocab/status/none/Hint: No status
Vocab/status/considering/Hint: Weighed up, not taken on yet
Vocab/status/todo/Hint: Taken on, not started
Vocab/status/doing/Hint: Started and being worked on
Vocab/status/paused/Hint: Started, then set aside
Vocab/status/done/Hint: Finished
Vocab/status/dropped/Hint: Decided against, will not happen

